@* Estilos de la bandeja + ficha "seg-*" (canon Poliza). Compartidos por Seguros y Siniestros: el bloque
   vivia inline en Seguros.razor y se movio aqui SIN cambios para que Siniestros use el MISMO look (no copia).
   Se emite inline (no css global) para conservar el alcance de antes: solo esta en el DOM con la pagina. *@
<style>
    .mod-pagehead { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .mod-pagetitle { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--propia-text-h1); margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: -.5px; }
    .mod-pagesub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--propia-text-muted); margin: 0; }
    .seg-loading { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 60px 0; }
    /* KPIs: se usan las clases globales .mod-stat* (tamano tb-bkpi de Tareas), sin override local. */
    .mod-filtros { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .mod-filtros-spacer { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 8px; }
    .seg-head-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .seg-search { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 9px; padding: 0 11px; background: var(--propia-bg-card); }
    .seg-search svg { color: var(--propia-text-faint); }
    .seg-search-inp { border: 0; outline: none; padding: 8px 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--propia-text-body); width: 260px; background: transparent; }
    .seg-fsel { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 9px; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--propia-text-secondary); background: var(--propia-bg-card); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .seg-fsel.on { border-color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); font-weight: 700; }
    .seg-fsel:hover { border-color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); }
    .seg-menu-wrap { position: relative; }
    .seg-menu-bd { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 40; }
    .seg-menu { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0; z-index: 41; min-width: 190px; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(30,40,60,.18); padding: 6px; }
    .seg-menu-it { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; border: 0; background: transparent; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--propia-text-body); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .seg-menu-it:hover { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); }
    .seg-menu-it.on { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); }
    /* Separadores de columna 1:1 con Unidades (decision de Alex: refactor de geometria aprobado).
       min-width:0 en las celdas de header Y de cuerpo (.seg-c) -> los tracks `fr` resuelven por peso
       (sin que el min-content de las etiquetas desvie el reparto), asi header y cuerpo quedan iguales
       y el border-right cae en el borde REAL de la columna. align-self:stretch -> la linea ocupa el
       alto de la fila. La etiqueta (.seg-th-lbl) recorta con ellipsis para no empujar el track; el
       chevron no se encoge. Ultima columna: sin separador. */
    /* padding vertical EN la celda (no en el contenedor grid): asi la celda, al estirarse
       (align-self:stretch), incluye ese alto y el separador border-right queda FULL-HEIGHT como
       en Unidades. horizontal 0 para no desalinear respecto a la columna del cuerpo. */
    .seg-head .seg-th { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; align-self: stretch; padding: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); }
    .seg-head .seg-th:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    /* Handle de redimensionar (= .mas-col-rz de Mascotas): franja invisible en el borde derecho del th;
       la guia la pinta el JS compartido (propiaTablaResize). El cursor grab del th lo da [data-clave]. */
    .seg-col-rz { position: absolute; top: 0; right: -4px; width: 8px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; z-index: 3; }
    .seg-col-rz::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; left: 3px; width: 2px; border-radius: 2px; background: transparent; transition: background .12s; }
    .seg-col-rz:hover::after { background: var(--propia-brand); }
    /* Divisor controles->datos: el expander del header (2do hijo, div vacio) lleva el separador full-height
       para aislar el bloque checkbox+expander de la 1a columna de datos (homogeneo, Alex 2026-10-08). */
    .seg-head > div:nth-child(2) { align-self: stretch; border-right: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); box-shadow: inset -1px 0 0 var(--propia-border-card); }
    .seg-th-lbl { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 0; }
    /* Chevron siempre visible + al borde derecho (1:1 Unidades). Header grid flex -> margin-left:auto. */
    .seg-th-edit { opacity: 1; margin-left: auto; margin-right: 12px; width: 18px; height: 18px; flex: 0 0 auto; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0; transition: opacity .12s, color .12s, background .12s; }
    .seg-head .seg-th:hover .seg-th-edit, .seg-th-edit:focus-visible { opacity: 1; }
    .seg-th-edit:hover { color: var(--propia-brand); background: var(--propia-brand-soft); }
    /* "+" agregar campo (columna) en el header, simetria con Unidades. */
    .seg-addcol-h { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; align-self: stretch; }
    .seg-addcol-btn { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--propia-border-card-2, var(--propia-border-card)); background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; }
    .seg-addcol-btn:hover { border-color: var(--propia-brand); color: var(--propia-brand); border-style: solid; }
    /* Boton "Filtros" + popover constructor de reglas (mismo diseno que Contratos/PQRS). */
    .seg-filtro-wrap { position: relative; }
    .seg-fbadge { background: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); color: var(--propia-text-inverse); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 20px; padding: 0 6px; min-width: 17px; height: 17px; margin-left: 5px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .seg-fpop { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 0; z-index: 41; width: 540px; max-width: 88vw; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 13px; box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(30,40,60,.22); padding: 12px; }
    .seg-fpop-empty { padding: 14px; text-align: center; color: var(--propia-text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .seg-frule { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .seg-frule-lead { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-muted); min-width: 42px; }
    .seg-frule-logic { min-width: 52px; }
    .seg-frule select, .seg-frule input { border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-input); border-radius: 7px; padding: 5px 7px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--propia-text-body); background: var(--propia-bg-card); font-family: inherit; }
    .seg-frule-f { flex: 1 1 120px; min-width: 90px; }
    .seg-frule-op { flex: 0 1 120px; }
    .seg-frule-v { flex: 1 1 120px; min-width: 90px; }
    .seg-frule-del { border: 0; background: var(--propia-bg-hover); color: var(--propia-text-muted); border-radius: 6px; width: 24px; height: 24px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .seg-frule-del:hover { background: var(--propia-danger-soft); color: var(--propia-danger); }
    .seg-fpop-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--propia-border-divider); }
    .seg-fadd { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; border: 0; background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); color: var(--propia-brand-hover); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
    .seg-fadd:hover { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-3); }
    .seg-fclear2 { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }
    .seg-fclear2:hover { color: var(--propia-danger); }
    /* Menu "Campos" (antes modal): popover anclado al boton, como Tareas. */
    .seg-campospop { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0; z-index: 41; width: 520px; max-width: 92vw; max-height: 72vh; overflow: auto; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(30,40,60,.2); padding: 12px; }
    .seg-campospop-h { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .4px; color: var(--propia-text-faint); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .mod-search-count { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--propia-text-muted); }
    .seg-toggle { display: inline-flex; gap: 2px; background: var(--propia-border-divider); border-radius: 9px; padding: 3px; }
    .seg-vt { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; }
    .seg-vt.on { background: var(--propia-bg-card); color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(27,42,58,.12); }

    .seg-empty { background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px dashed var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 34px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
    .seg-empty strong { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--propia-text-body); }
    .seg-empty span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--propia-text-muted); }

    .seg-table { position: relative; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .seg-table .tbl-fab { bottom: 54px; }
    .seg-scroll { overflow: auto; max-height: calc(100vh - 300px); overflow-anchor: none; }
    /* padding-left:0: la 1a columna (checkbox) arranca pegada al borde como Unidades. */
    .seg-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1.1fr 1.6fr 1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1.1fr 1fr .7fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 0; min-width: 1000px; }
    /* Header canonico (estandar Tareas): tokens homogeneos, sticky top OPACO. */
    /* Header canonico (= Unidades / tabla-base.css): bg opaco, 11.5/700 uppercase, color text-secondary,
       border-bottom border-card, sticky top0 z6. Tipografia en la fila; la heredan las celdas. */
    /* padding vertical 0 en el contenedor (lo llevan las celdas .seg-th) para que el separador sea
       full-height; horizontal 16px lo mantiene .seg-grid. */
    /* altura 47px (= Unidades); antes ~35px. height + contenido centrado (las celdas estiran para el divisor). */
    .seg-head { background: var(--propia-bg-table-head); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-secondary); letter-spacing: .4px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 6; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; height: 47px; box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; }
    .seg-row { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--propia-border-divider); font-size: 13px; color: var(--propia-text-body); }
    .seg-row:hover { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); }
    /* min-width:0 -> el grid resuelve los tracks fr por peso (igual que el header) y habilita el
       recorte con ellipsis; asi header y cuerpo quedan alineados columna a columna. */
    .seg-c { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 0; }
    .seg-c--num { font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-h1); }
    .seg-c--aseg { font-weight: 600; color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); }
    .seg-exp-col { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    /* expander icono pelado (= .tbl-exp-btn de Unidades): transparente, pad 6, radius 7, color muted; fondo al hover. */
    .seg-exp { border: 0; padding: 6px; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .12s, background .12s, color .12s; }
    .seg-row:hover .seg-exp { opacity: 1; }
    .seg-exp:hover { color: var(--propia-brand); background: var(--propia-brand-soft); }
    .seg-newrow .seg-exp-fijo { opacity: 1; }
    .seg-exp-fijo:disabled { opacity: .3; cursor: default; }
    /* Expander mudo de la fila de alta: solo alineacion, sin accion (guardado invisible). */
    .seg-exp-mut { cursor: default; }
    /* Fila de alta inline: inputs con estilo canonico de Tareas (.tb-nf-inp), boton estilo Zonas. */
    .seg-nf-inp { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--propia-text-body); background: transparent; outline: none; font-family: inherit; transition: border-color .12s, box-shadow .12s; }
    .seg-nf-inp:focus { border: 1.5px solid var(--propia-brand); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(109,79,227,.14); }
    .seg-c--auto { color: var(--propia-text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
    .seg-row-add { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); background: var(--propia-brand-soft); border: 1px solid var(--propia-brand-border); border-radius: 7px; padding: 5px 8px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; white-space: nowrap; }
    .seg-row-add:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--propia-brand-soft); }
    .seg-row-add:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
    /* Celda de la CTA de alta canon (.row-add--sm): ocupa el ancho del cuerpo, alineada a la izquierda. */
    .seg-nf-ctacell { display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .seg-cta-row { cursor: default; }
    .seg-row-nuevo { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2) !important; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--propia-brand); }
    /* Seleccion multiple + barra de acciones masivas (canon Unidades/Roles). */
    .seg-sel { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .seg-chk { width: 16px; height: 16px; accent-color: var(--propia-brand); cursor: pointer; margin: 0; }
    .seg-row-sel { background: var(--propia-brand-soft) !important; }
    .seg-selbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; background: var(--propia-brand-soft); border: 1px solid var(--propia-brand-border); border-radius: 10px; }
    .seg-selbar-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-brand); }
    .seg-selbar-del { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #F3C9CB; background: var(--propia-bg-card); color: var(--propia-error-strong); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .seg-selbar-del:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #FBEBEC; }
    .seg-selbar-del:disabled { opacity: .6; cursor: default; }
    .seg-selbar-x { border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); background: var(--propia-bg-card); color: var(--propia-text-secondary); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .seg-selbar-x:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--propia-brand); color: var(--propia-brand); }
    .seg-toast { position: sticky; bottom: 10px; margin: 10px auto 0; width: fit-content; background: var(--propia-success-hover); color: var(--propia-text-inverse); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 9px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(21,112,63,.28); }
    /* la variante de error va DESPUES de .seg-toast: misma especificidad, gana la ultima */
    .seg-toast--error { background: var(--propia-danger); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(215,38,61,.28); }

    .seg-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .seg-card { text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; background: var(--propia-bg-card); cursor: pointer; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
    .seg-card:hover { border-color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(109,79,227,.10); }
    .seg-card-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
    .seg-card-aseg { font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-h1); }
    .seg-card-num { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--propia-text-secondary); }
    .seg-card-meta { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--propia-text-muted); }

    .seg-group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 16px 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--propia-border-divider); }
    .seg-group--card { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-top: 0; padding: 6px 2px; }
    .seg-group-t { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 3px 11px; }
    .seg-group-n { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-muted); background: var(--propia-bg-card-soft); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1px 9px; }
    /* Cabecera de grupo con totales por columna: usa .seg-grid (mismo grid que las filas, via GridStyle inline);
       la franja va al contenedor para cubrir toda la fila; el lead conserva las pastillas de titulo/conteo. */
    .seg-grouprow { border-top: 1px solid var(--propia-border-divider); }
    .seg-grouprow.seg-gl0 { background: var(--propia-brand-soft-2, var(--propia-brand-soft)); }
    .seg-grouprow.seg-gl1 { background: var(--propia-bg-card-soft); }
    .seg-grouprow.seg-gl2 { background: var(--propia-bg-card); }
    .seg-grouplead { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .seg-groupagg { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--propia-text-h1); }
    .seg-groupagg .seg-aggtag { margin-left: 5px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .4px; color: var(--propia-text-faint); }

    .seg-badge { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px; }
    .seg-badge--verde { color: var(--propia-ok); background: var(--propia-ok-soft); }
    .seg-badge--amarillo { color: var(--propia-warn); background: var(--propia-warn-soft); }
    .seg-badge--rojo { color: var(--propia-error-strong); background: var(--propia-danger-soft); }
    .seg-badge--none { color: var(--propia-text-muted); background: var(--propia-border-divider); }

    /* Modal */
    .seg-ov { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(27,42,58,.5); z-index: 1080; }
    /* Frame estandar de la maqueta: mas ancho y alto fijo (no salta al cambiar de pestana). */
    .seg-modal { position: fixed; z-index: 1081; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: min(1056px, calc(100vw - 32px)); height: 86vh; max-height: 880px; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(27,42,58,.32); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .seg-modal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--propia-border-divider); }
    .seg-modal-ic { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 11px; background: var(--propia-brand-soft); color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .seg-modal-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--propia-text-h1); }
    .seg-modal-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--propia-text-muted); }
    .seg-x { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 9px; border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); background: var(--propia-bg-card); color: var(--propia-text-muted); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .seg-tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 0 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--propia-border-divider); }
    .seg-tabs button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--propia-text-muted); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; margin-bottom: -1px; }
    .seg-tabs button.on { color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); border-bottom-color: var(--propia-brand, var(--propia-brand)); }
    .seg-tab-n { font-size: 10px; background: var(--propia-border-divider); color: var(--propia-text-secondary); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1px 6px; margin-left: 4px; }
    /* Cuerpo: flex en columna; cada pestana maneja su propio scroll para que el alto del modal NO cambie. */
    .seg-modal-body { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    /* Pestana Poliza: 2 columnas (formulario + panel de Actividad lateral, como la maqueta .tfm-2col). */
    .seg-2col { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 20px; }
    .seg-2col--solo { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .seg-mainpane { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 4px; }
    .seg-actpane { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    /* Pestanas Documentos / Reclamaciones: ancho completo, scroll propio. */
    .seg-docpane { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; padding: 16px 20px; }
    .seg-reclpane { flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px 20px; }

    /* Panel de Actividad (CALCA .act-* de la maqueta): chat por-poliza en la columna derecha. */
    .act-panel { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--propia-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--propia-border-card); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
